### 11. Intentar crear con calificación inválida (mayor a 10)
POST http://{{host_name}}:{{PORT}}/api/watchlist HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "titulo": "Shutter Island",
    "tipo": "movie",
